# Local development uses the bundled PGlite database and needs none of this.
# Point DATABASE_URL at Supabase/RDS/any Postgres to switch over — no code changes.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@host:5432/dbname

# Absolute base URL, used when generating customer-facing links in messages.
# APP_URL=https://app.example.com

# Payments (adapters/payments.ts). Without these, payments are recorded but no
# money moves — the same as taking cash or a cheque.
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Maps (adapters/maps.ts). Until one is set, the HUD says the map is not connected
# rather than drawing invented pins.
# MAPBOX_TOKEN=
# GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=

# Weather (adapters/weather.ts). Until set, no forecast is shown or invented.
# WEATHER_API_KEY=

# Local database server
# PGLITE_PORT=5433
# PGLITE_DIR=./.pgdata
